  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "down_l",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 500,
   "text": "focus beats scale, so teams without\na closed lab's budget reach the frontier",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "strokeColor": "#9f1239"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "mb",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 590,
   "text": "MOVEMENT B \u00b7 WHO SETS THE STANDARD \u00b7 the politics",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "strokeColor": "#155e75"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b13",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 625,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 120,
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "strokeColor": "#155e75",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "The open-model gap has largely closed:\na lead of months, not a moat\nclaims#13",
    "fontSize": 19,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#134e4a"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b18",
   "x": 530,
   "y": 625,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 120,
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "strokeColor": "#155e75",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "Open weights are a strategy:\nbecome the substrate others build on\nclaims#18",
    "fontSize": 19,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#134e4a"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "b17",
   "x": 980,
   "y": 625,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 120,
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "strokeColor": "#155e75",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "label": {
    "text": "Benchmarks steer the field:\nwhat is measured gets built\nclaims#17",
    "fontSize": 19,
    "fontFamily": 2,
    "strokeColor": "#134e4a"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "cite",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 780,
   "text": "Sources: #439 Eugene Cheah (Featherless.ai) \u00b7 #189 Amir Haghighat (Baseten) \u00b7 #74 Olive Song (MiniMax) \u00b7 #476 Dylan Patel (SemiAnalysis)\n#13 Raia Hadsell (DeepMind) \u00b7 #267 Jack Rae (DeepMind) \u00b7 #67 Jacob Kahn (FAIR Meta) \u00b7 #253 Alex Duffy (Every.to) \u00b7 #137 Barr Yaron (Amplify)\n#9 Omar Sanseviero (DeepMind) \u00b7 #528 Devendra Chaplot (Mistral AI) \u00b7 #480 Kathleen Kenealy (DeepMind) \u00b7 #400 Junyang Lin (Alibaba Qwen)",
